<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">ずっと真夜中でいいのに。 (Zutto Mayonaka de Iinoni.)</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter><songwriter>ぬゆり</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">生活的伪装</text><text for="L2">像往常一样得过且过</text><text for="L3">说过一次“我明白了”就再也无法回头</text><text for="L4">是信仰犯吧</text><text for="L5">晚饭时哭过之后</text><text for="L6">你笑了起来</text><text for="L7">“我也是一样的”</text><text for="L8">合计着虚假的心情</text><text for="L9">倾诉着沉默着不断积累着</text><text for="L10">无论什么</text><text for="L11">都连当面说一句“再见”</text><text for="L12">的资格也没有</text><text for="L13">我蜷缩进灰尘中 咬着秒针</text><text for="L14">在白日梦中狠狠敲碎</text><text for="L15">可是时钟没有坏 依旧不肯停止</text><text for="L16">依旧不知“真相”地前进着</text><text for="L17">真想就此掠夺隐藏忘记一切</text><text for="L18">就算我们没有任何一点可以相互理解</text><text for="L19">见面后不要用“对不起”</text><text for="L20">来回答我</text><text for="L21">我不需要这种虚无缥缈的话</text><text for="L22">无法消除的后遗症</text><text for="L23">才说过“什么都会接受”</text><text for="L24">便已经无法再回到过去</text><text for="L25">就算经过一团糟</text><text for="L26">就算不是为了我</text><text for="L27">我也得到了你的保护</text><text for="L28">眼睛嘴巴都快要没有意义</text><text for="L29">我把它们全都堵住无法动弹</text><text for="L30">不要来找我</text><text for="L31">不要管我好吗</text><text for="L32">无论看向哪里无论在哪里都无法张开</text><text for="L33">蜷缩潜藏在肺里 咬着秒针</text><text for="L34">在白日梦中狠狠敲碎</text><text for="L35">可是时钟没有坏 依旧不肯停止</text><text for="L36">如果还要继续演戏</text><text for="L37">真想就此掠夺隐藏忘记一切</text><text for="L38">就算我们没有任何一点可以相互理解</text><text for="L39">见面后不要用“对不起”</text><text for="L40">来回答我</text><text for="L41">我不需要这种虚无缥缈的话</text><text for="L42">纠缠着 呐喊着 迎不来清晨</text><text for="L43">大笑着 躺卧着 真是可鄙可怜</text><text for="L44">并非某人之错的事</text><text for="L45">也想找个人来怪罪</text><text for="L46">“你心里有我吗？”</text><text for="L47">其实我是知道的</text><text for="L48">就算放弃了也会不自觉地去相信</text><text for="L49">真想就此掠夺隐藏忘记一切</text><text for="L50">真想就此掠夺隐藏忘记一切</text><text for="L51">真想就此掠夺隐藏与你倾诉</text><text for="L52">就算我们没有任何一点可以相互理解</text><text for="L53">见面后不要用“对不起”</text><text for="L54">来回答我</text><text for="L55">“为什么要拯救充满怀疑的我”</text><text for="L56">我不需要无可救药的谎言</text><text for="L57">夜空已经放晴</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:29.544" end="0:31.400" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.544" end="0:29.800">生</span><span begin="0:29.800" end="0:30.104">活</span><span begin="0:30.104" end="0:30.264">の</span><span begin="0:30.264" end="0:30.408">偽</span><span begin="0:30.408" end="0:31.400">造</span></p><p begin="0:31.656" end="0:33.489" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.656" end="0:31.825">い</span><span begin="0:31.825" end="0:31.980">つ</span><span begin="0:31.980" end="0:32.152">も</span><span begin="0:32.152" end="0:32.429">通</span><span begin="0:32.429" end="0:32.567">り</span><span begin="0:32.567" end="0:32.808">通</span><span begin="0:32.808" end="0:32.983">り</span><span begin="0:32.983" end="0:33.136">過</span><span begin="0:33.136" end="0:33.283">ぎ</span><span begin="0:33.283" end="0:33.489">て</span></p><p begin="0:33.666" end="0:35.805" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.666" end="0:33.811">一</span><span begin="0:33.811" end="0:34.089">回</span><span begin="0:34.089" end="0:34.168">言</span><span begin="0:34.169" end="0:34.248">っ</span><span begin="0:34.248" end="0:34.400">た</span><span begin="0:34.400" end="0:34.545">わ</span><span begin="0:34.545" end="0:34.616">か</span><span begin="0:34.616" end="0:34.687">っ</span><span begin="0:34.688" end="0:34.832">た</span><span begin="0:34.832" end="0:35.112">戻</span><span begin="0:35.112" end="0:35.248">ら</span><span begin="0:35.248" end="0:35.392">な</span><span begin="0:35.392" end="0:35.805">い</span></p><p begin="0:36.791" end="0:38.691" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.791" end="0:37.087">確</span><span begin="0:37.087" end="0:37.343">信</span><span begin="0:37.343" end="0:37.550">犯</span><span begin="0:37.550" end="0:37.704">で</span><span begin="0:37.704" end="0:37.968">し</span><span begin="0:37.968" end="0:38.691">ょ</span></p><p begin="0:39.243" end="0:40.840" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.243" end="0:39.443">夕</span><span begin="0:39.443" end="0:39.741">食</span><span begin="0:39.741" end="0:39.896">中</span><span begin="0:39.896" end="0:40.051">に</span><span begin="0:40.051" end="0:40.193">泣</span><span begin="0:40.193" end="0:40.352">い</span><span begin="0:40.352" end="0:40.496">た</span><span begin="0:40.496" end="0:40.840">後</span></p><p begin="0:41.024" end="0:42.986" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.024" end="0:41.400">君</span><span begin="0:41.400" end="0:41.657">は</span><span begin="0:41.657" end="0:42.074">笑</span><span begin="0:42.074" end="0:42.282">っ</span><span begin="0:42.282" end="0:42.406">て</span><span begin="0:42.406" end="0:42.530">っ</span><span begin="0:42.530" end="0:42.986">た</span></p><p begin="0:44.066" end="0:46.344" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.217" end="0:44.665">私</span><span begin="0:44.665" end="0:44.874">も</span><span begin="0:44.874" end="0:44.949">そ</span><span begin="0:44.950" end="0:45.025">う</span><span begin="0:45.025" end="0:45.195">だ</span><span begin="0:45.195" end="0:45.615">よ</span><span begin="0:46.035" end="0:46.035">っ</span><span begin="0:46.035" end="0:46.344">て</span></p><p begin="0:46.344" end="0:48.272" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.344" end="0:47.132">偽</span><span begin="0:47.132" end="0:47.165">り</span><span begin="0:47.165" end="0:47.198">の</span><span begin="0:47.198" end="0:47.231">気</span><span begin="0:47.231" end="0:47.264">持</span><span begin="0:47.264" end="0:47.498">ち</span><span begin="0:47.498" end="0:47.696">合</span><span begin="0:47.696" end="0:47.896">算</span><span begin="0:47.896" end="0:48.047">し</span><span begin="0:48.047" end="0:48.272">て</span></p><p begin="0:48.424" end="0:51.351" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.424" end="0:48.600">吐</span><span begin="0:48.600" end="0:48.762">い</span><span begin="0:48.762" end="0:48.904">て</span><span begin="0:48.904" end="0:49.139">黙</span><span begin="0:49.139" end="0:49.218">っ</span><span begin="0:49.218" end="0:49.371">て</span><span begin="0:49.371" end="0:49.445">ず</span><span begin="0:49.445" end="0:49.519">っ</span><span begin="0:49.520" end="0:49.683">と</span><span begin="0:49.683" end="0:49.864">溜</span><span begin="0:49.864" end="0:49.944">ま</span><span begin="0:49.944" end="0:50.024">っ</span><span begin="0:50.024" end="0:51.080">て</span><span begin="0:51.080" end="0:51.351">く</span></p><p begin="0:51.704" end="0:53.489" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.704" end="0:52.016">何</span><span begin="0:52.016" end="0:52.168">が</span><span begin="0:52.168" end="0:52.328">何</span><span begin="0:52.328" end="0:52.472">で</span><span begin="0:52.472" end="0:53.489">も</span></p><p begin="0:53.872" end="0:55.632" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.872" end="0:54.088">面</span><span begin="0:54.088" end="0:54.296">と</span><span begin="0:54.296" end="0:54.448">向</span><span begin="0:54.448" end="0:54.532">か</span><span begin="0:54.532" end="0:54.616">っ</span><span begin="0:54.616" end="0:54.768">て</span><span begin="0:54.768" end="0:54.940">さ</span><span begin="0:54.940" end="0:55.223">よ</span><span begin="0:55.223" end="0:55.432">な</span><span begin="0:55.432" end="0:55.632">ら</span></p><p begin="0:55.632" end="0:59.402" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.632" end="0:55.840">す</span><span begin="0:55.840" end="0:56.024">る</span><span begin="0:56.024" end="0:56.224">資</span><span begin="0:56.224" end="0:56.664">格</span><span begin="0:56.664" end="0:57.093">も</span><span begin="0:57.093" end="0:57.323">な</span><span begin="0:57.323" end="0:57.826">い</span><span begin="0:57.826" end="0:58.226">ま</span><span begin="0:58.226" end="0:58.450">ま</span><span begin="0:58.450" end="0:58.930">僕</span><span begin="0:58.930" end="0:59.402">は</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="0:59.582" end="1:02.658" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.582" end="0:59.926">灰</span><span begin="0:59.926" end="1:00.093">に</span><span begin="1:00.093" end="1:00.507">潜</span><span begin="1:00.507" end="1:01.076">り</span><span begin="1:01.076" end="1:01.506">秒</span><span begin="1:01.506" end="1:01.901">針</span><span begin="1:01.901" end="1:02.138">を</span><span begin="1:02.138" end="1:02.410">噛</span><span begin="1:02.410" end="1:02.658">み</span></p><p begin="1:02.960" end="1:06.618" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.960" end="1:03.395">白</span><span begin="1:03.395" end="1:03.784">昼</span><span begin="1:03.784" end="1:04.032">夢</span><span begin="1:04.032" end="1:04.232">の</span><span begin="1:04.232" end="1:04.672">中</span><span begin="1:04.672" end="1:04.936">で</span><span begin="1:04.936" end="1:05.178">ガ</span><span begin="1:05.178" end="1:05.420">ン</span><span begin="1:05.421" end="1:05.644">ガ</span><span begin="1:05.644" end="1:05.867">ン</span><span begin="1:05.867" end="1:06.200">砕</span><span begin="1:06.200" end="1:06.392">い</span><span begin="1:06.392" end="1:06.618">た</span></p><p begin="1:06.872" end="1:10.120" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.872" end="1:07.064">で</span><span begin="1:07.064" end="1:07.248">も</span><span begin="1:07.248" end="1:07.672">壊</span><span begin="1:07.672" end="1:07.888">れ</span><span begin="1:07.888" end="1:08.083">な</span><span begin="1:08.083" end="1:08.432">い</span><span begin="1:08.432" end="1:08.640">止</span><span begin="1:08.640" end="1:08.829">